00:16:18,039 --> 00:16:21,279
eksi artı 1

108
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:23,500
eksi artı 2

109
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:25,459
şeklinde. Yani bir

110
00:16:25,459 --> 00:16:27,000
tam sayıdır.

111
00:16:27,839 --> 00:16:28,079
n

